<title>USA: Tropical storm Victor dissipated over China - WSC.</title>
<headline>Tropical storm Victor dissipated over China - WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical storm Victor dissipated over southern China, with showers expected to taper off over the next few days, independent forecaster Weather Services Corp said on Monday.</p>
<p>Victor came ashore near Hong Kong in southern China, bringing heavy rain which caused flash flooding and some property damage.</p>
